    {
      "author": "Samruddhi Rathod",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": "⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\n\nSainath Chicken Thali -Absolutely Amazing and my personal favourite! 🍗❤️\n\nThe chicken thali at Sainath is simply outstanding! The taste, flavour and overall combination are just perfect. The chicken was delicious, the rassa was rich, spicy and full of flavour, and the combination with fresh bhakri and perfectly cooked rice was absolutely amazing.\n\nThe rice deserves a special mention—so perfectly cooked and paired beautifully with the rassa and chicken. Every bite of the bhakri with that flavourful rassa was incredibly satisfying.\n\nA simple, authentic and properly satisfying chicken thali with everything coming together perfectly. Definitely worth trying! 😍🍗🔥",
      "date": "2026-08-10T17:31:57.837Z",
      "likes": 0
    },
    {
